    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>Andrew D. Huberman, Ph.D.</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\"><br>Huberman Lab 的新一集已上线：运动练习以加强你的身心连接 | Ido Portal<br><br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=0\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>0:00</span></span></a>  Ido 门户<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=198\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>3:18</span></span></a>  清醒, 过渡状态, 睡眠, 清醒梦<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=630\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>10:30</span></span></a>  冥想，工具：微冥想<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=835\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>13:55</span></span></a>  赞助商: Rorra & ROKA<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=1025\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>17:05</span></span></a>  冥想，焦虑<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=1194\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>19:54</span></span></a>  身心状态<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=1481\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>24:41</span></span></a>  玩耍 vs 纪律，动机 & 意志，敬畏<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=2245\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>37:25</span></span></a>  意志力 vs 自律，培养意志；体能训练<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=2840\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>47:20</span></span></a>  赞助商: AG1<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=2946\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>49:06</span></span></a>  游戏的力量，刚性<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=3281\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>54:41</span></span></a>  俏皮的克制，柔和<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=3657\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:00:57</span></span></a>  微妙的意识涟漪, 粒度, 身体分辨率<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=4176\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:09:36</span></span></a>  语言, 歧义, 舞蹈; 致幻剂<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=4519\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:15:19</span></span></a>  赞助商: LMNT<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=4611\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:16:51</span></span></a>  关注日常活动与运动<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=5097\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:24:57</span></span></a>  挑战体制，生活作为一种实践<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=5557\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:32:37</span></span></a>  意识与时间；情感、心理与身体营养素<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=5921\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:38:41</span></span></a>  社交媒体，粒度的重要性<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=6221\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:43:41</span></span></a>  觉察转变，库玛卡练习；拮抗<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=6836\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:53:56</span></span></a>  赞助商：功能<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=6937\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>1:55:37</span></span></a>  怯懦，悔恨；感觉脱敏<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=7433\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:03:53</span></span></a>  关系，动态实践<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=7859\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:10:59</span></span></a>  音乐，运动<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=8181\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:16:21</span></span></a>  艺术; 运动模型; 通过运动的觉察<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=8844\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:27:24</span></span></a>  鲜活时刻与成长，留意细微之处<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=9323\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:35:23</span></span></a>  Air Sense, 滑板运动, 信心; Meta-运动<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=10172\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:49:32</span></span></a>  不完美之美，拥抱不确定性<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475?t=10632\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span>2:57:12</span></span></a>  零成本支持, YouTube, Spotify 和 Apple 关注, 评论与反馈, 协议手册, 赞助商, 社交媒体, 神经网络通讯<br><br>包括付费合作 .</div><div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2071428953018126336/img/2Qe4LM8YjOeKXXVH.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" /></div><div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/hubermanlab/status/2071594543133147475\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2071428953018126336/img/2Qe4LM8YjOeKXXVH.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div></article>",
